        "created_at": "2023-09-15T21:03:59.437Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yeah, maybe I should be leaving him for last. What’s the worst though is starting with Glamour (and Re-Volt) cause then you’re forced to take her out before your team gets wiped.</p>\n<p>I probably also agree with the other point about Steel being the worst cause he can ramp up very quickly with multiple agents and deal a boatload of damage.</p>",
